    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>护甲（中甲），珍稀（需同调）</em><br />这套色彩鲜艳、花团锦簇的护甲铸成于 <strong>妖精荒野Feywild</strong> 之中，它充满着那个奇幻位面的诱人能量。<br />穿着这套护甲期间，你为防止陷入或结束 <strong>魅惑&amp;Reference[condition=charmed]</strong> 状态所做的豁免具有优势。<br />这套护甲具有3发充能。你可以消耗一发充能以用其施展法术<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.RpBbOYseLZCFXaFY]{强迫术 Compulsion}</em>（豁免DC15）。这套护甲在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d3]]发已消耗的充能数。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\">一种由厚毛皮制作的粗糙护甲。常见使用人群包括：野蛮人部落、邪恶类人生物以及其它缺少资源制作更好护甲的人。</p></div></div><p>This colorful, flowery armor was forged in the Feywild and is infused with that plane's captivating magic.</p><p>While wearing this armor, you have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the &amp;Reference[condition=charmed] condition on yourself.</p><p>This armor has 3 charges. You can use an action to expend a charge to cast the @spell[Compulsion] spell (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>) from this armor. The armor regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>This crude armor consists of thick furs and pelts. It is commonly worn by barbarian tribes, evil humanoids, and other folk who lack access to the tools and materials needed to create better armor.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
